        "note": "The statements use pointwise sums of finite sets and ZMod q from Mathlib. The proofs use its Freiman isomorphisms, the Plünnecke-Ruzsa inequality, Ruzsa's covering lemma, the Fourier transform on finite abelian groups, Z-lattices and Smith normal form. Mathlib has no generalized arithmetic progressions and no form of Chang's theorem.",
